# Nabad Producer — staging / simulator first

Nabad Producer (guided full song · 50 credits · Lyria Pro) ships on **staging** first.

## Env (Vercel Preview)

- `NABAD_PRODUCER_ENABLED=1` — required for `/api/music/producer/*`
- Optional: `NABAD_PRODUCER_CREDIT_COST=50`, `NABAD_PRODUCER_MODEL`

Keep **off** on Production until explicit ship approval.

## Paths

- UI: `#/nabad-producer`, Create hub card `data-home-card="producer"`
- API: `/api/music/producer/chat`, `/api/music/producer/generate`
- Lib: `api/_lib/nabad-producer-lib.js`, `src/nabad-producer.js`

## Test

- `npm run sim` (staging API)
- Pro account required; 50 credits debited on generate
